{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":61,"count":32,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L04-1-02\",\"還是\",\"還是\",\"还是\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你要喝什麼？咖啡還是茶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào hē shénme? Kāfēi háishì chá?","english":"What do you want to drink? Coffee or tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-02","sourceFront":"還是","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"好啊！你想喝什麼？咖啡還是茶？","pinyin":"Hǎo a! Nǐ xiǎng hē shénme? Kāfēi háishì chá?","english":"Okay! What would you like to drink? Coffee or tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"你要果汁還是牛奶？","pinyin":"Nǐ yào guǒzhī háishì niúnǎi?","english":"Do you want juice or milk?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-3-07","sourceFront":"牛奶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們要怎麼去？坐捷運還是坐公車？","pinyin":"Wǒmen yào zěnme qù? Zuò jiéyùn háishì zuò gōngchē?","english":"How do we get there? By MRT or bus?","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"還(still) + 是(be) → 'is it still...?' → in questions 還是 means 'or'."},{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-11\",\"風景\",\"風景\",\"风景\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你喜歡山上的風景還是海邊的風景？","pinyin":"Nǐ xǐhuān shānshàng de fēngjǐng háishì hǎibiān de fēngjǐng?","english":"Do you like the scenery on the mountain or on the beach?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-11","sourceFront":"風景","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天天氣不錯，海邊的風景也很漂亮，我想去游泳，妳們想去嗎？","pinyin":"Jīntiān tiānqì búcuò, hǎibiān de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliàng, wǒ xiǎng qù yóuyǒng, nǐmen xiǎng qù ma?","english":"The weather is pretty good today, so is the view at the beach. I want to go swimming. Do you want to go?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"風(wind) + 景(scenery): the scenery shaped by wind."},{"key":"[\"B1L08-2-07\",\"鞋子\",\"鞋子\",\"鞋子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"沒關係，我們可以下個週末再來看。對了，妳要買鞋子吧？","pinyin":"Méiguānxi, wǒmen kěyǐ xià ge zhōumò zài lái kàn. Duìle, nǐ yào mǎi xiézi ba?","english":"It’s okay; we can come again next weekend. By the way, you want to buy shoes, don’t you?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"鞋子都在一樓，我們到樓下去吧！九點了，百貨公司快要關了。","pinyin":"Xiézi dōu zài yì lóu, wǒmen dào lóuxià qù ba! Jiǔ diǎn le, bǎihuògōngsī kuàiyào guān le.","english":"All the shoes are on the first floor. Let’s go downstairs. It’s 9:00; the department store is closing soon.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"百貨公司裡有很多衣服、鞋子和皮包，都是最新的，所以很多年輕女生喜歡到百貨公司去，漂亮的、流行的衣服，她們都想穿穿看。","pinyin":"Bǎihuògōngsī lǐ yǒu hěn duō yīfu, xiézi hé píbāo, dōu shì zuì xīn de, suǒyǐ hěn duō niánqīng nǚshēng xǐhuān dào bǎihuògōngsī qù, piàoliang de, liúxíng de yīfu, tāmen dōu xiǎng chuānchuān kàn.","english":"Clothes, shoes and purses in department stores are all the latest; therefore, many young ladies like to go there and try on both beautiful and trendy items.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-3-01","sourceFront":"年輕","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3}],"wordHook":"鞋(shoe) + 子(noun suffix) → your shoes: 鞋子(shoes)."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-2-11\",\"小时\",\"小時/鐘頭\",\"小时/钟头\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"一個小時以前，他還在這裡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-11","sourceFront":"小時","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我站了兩個小時了，好累！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-16","sourceFront":"站","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我已經坐了四、五個小時了，想出去走走！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-17","sourceFront":"坐","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"帶這麼重的東西，走了兩個小時，我覺得很累。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-15","sourceFront":"重","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我哥哥是警察，他每天工作十個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-04","sourceFront":"警察","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從中部坐車到南部去，差不多要兩個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-13","sourceFront":"中部","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從昨天晚上到現在，已經下了十個小時的雨了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-23","sourceFront":"雨","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他喜歡玩手機遊戲，差不多每天玩兩個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-3-12","sourceFront":"遊戲","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從我家到學校要一個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-13","sourceFront":"要","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"山本良介還在台灣學中文，他的中文課明年二月才結束。我今天有三個小時的數學課，剛剛才下課。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-26","sourceFront":"才","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"念了一個小時的書以後，你最好休息十分鐘。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-28","sourceFront":"念書","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然我排隊排了一個小時才買到跨年演唱會的票，可是很值得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-27","sourceFront":"值得","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林小姐弄錯了約會的時間，所以遲到了半個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-19","sourceFront":"弄錯","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的體力很好，每天工作十幾個小時也不累。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-05","sourceFront":"體力","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我這個星期很忙，每天下班後都得加三個小時的班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-1-28","sourceFront":"加班","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的平板最近不太正常，才用了一個鐘頭就沒電了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-18","sourceFront":"正常","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我和姊姊小時候常為了搶玩具吵個沒完，有時候還打架呢","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-41","sourceFront":"搶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"珍珍每天大約看兩個小時的臺灣連續劇，目的是要(訓)練自己的中文聽力","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-42","sourceFront":"練","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們的足球教練認為，比賽前跑步是必要的訓練，從明天起每天得跑一個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-06","sourceFront":"必要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李進公司的頭三個月，每天上班要花兩個小時，後來搬到公司附近，走路十分鐘就到了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-18","sourceFront":"頭","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"只要你堅持每天學習一個小時的中文，我保證你的程度一定會越來越好的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-07","sourceFront":"堅持","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"章先生念國小時，父親帶著他上山下海、到處旅遊，那是屬於他們的美好記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-13","sourceFront":"記憶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這場網球比賽打得很激烈，已經打了五個小時了，還不知道誰輸誰贏。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-15","sourceFront":"激烈","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小時候爺爺常陪我做功課、教我打球和釣魚，現在回想起那段時間，感覺真幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-26","sourceFront":"回想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽實在太會做飯了，只用了一個小時就變出一桌既豐富又好吃的大餐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-19","sourceFront":"變","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"易先生對戲劇有很大的興趣，小時候的夢想就是當一名成功的演員。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-16","sourceFront":"戲劇","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"導遊忘了跟小湯約好在紅毛城門口見面，害他白（白）等了一個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-11","sourceFront":"白白","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他們從小時候就很要好，有困難時一起解決，有好東西也會分給對方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-40","sourceFront":"要好","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果工作太忙，每天最少還是應該運動半個小時，對健康比較好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-27","sourceFront":"最少","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天兩小時的會議，因為要討論的事增加而延長了三十分。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-23","sourceFront":"延長","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從小時候起，他的第一志願就是當一位保護國家的軍人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-03","sourceFront":"志願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我小時候最棒的休閒活動是到爺爺的菜園挖地種菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-13","sourceFront":"挖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-17\",\"约会\",\"約會\",\"约会\",\"Vi/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"王小姐跟男朋友約會的時候，都穿著很漂亮的衣服。今天晚上哥哥跟女朋友有個約會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-17","sourceFront":"約會","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"第一次約會的時候，林先生感覺(到)自己很緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"林小姐弄錯了約會的時間，所以遲到了半個小時。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-1-19","sourceFront":"弄錯","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我姐姐最近戀愛了，每個週末都跟男朋友約會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-25","sourceFront":"戀愛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小章已經結婚了，還常常跟其他女生約會，真是太花心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-26","sourceFront":"花心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:要是你發現男朋友對你越來越冷淡，還常跟女網友約會， 你會原諒他嗎？ B:這麼花心的男人，絕對不值得原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-23","sourceFront":"原諒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"淡水的夕陽很美，如此的美麗風景，是約會的極佳地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-26","sourceFront":"如此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:喲，你今天怎麼穿得這麼帥？ B:下午要參加公司茶會，得穿得正式一些？ A:那下次跟我約會時，也要這麼穿呦！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-03","sourceFront":"喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-14\",\"掛\",\"掛\",\"挂\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"牆上掛著的那張畫是我爸爸畫的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-14","sourceFront":"掛","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"看病以前要先掛號，再照號碼進去看醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-12","sourceFront":"掛號","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"病人得先掛了號才可以看病。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-12","sourceFront":"掛號","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個衣櫃有點兒淺，這件厚大衣掛不進去，就算掛進去了， 門也關不起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-16","sourceFront":"淺","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外面風大雨大，媽媽只好把還沒乾的衣服收進來，掛在屋內。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-17","sourceFront":"內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"寄掛號信雖然貴了一點兒，可是比較可靠。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-47","sourceFront":"掛號信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天上健康教育課時，老師在教室裡掛了一張人體血管圖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-40","sourceFront":"血管","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他把朋友送他的畫先捲起來，等有空時再找地方掛上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-28","sourceFront":"捲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-23\",\"成長\",\"成長\",\"成长\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"參加社團活動，是讓自己成長的好機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"孩子出國留學以後，父母發現孩子成長了不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我們的成長經驗、教育背景都差不多，所以想法也很像。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-22","sourceFront":"背景","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"錢老闆滿腦子都是工作，每天只想著怎麼讓公司成長得快一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-26","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司出版的小說，陪著不少讀者一塊兒成長，也帶給他們無窮的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-02","sourceFront":"無窮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想加入社會服務組織，幫助別人的同時也讓自己成長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-06","sourceFront":"組織","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"政府最主要的任務應是維持並保護社會安全，其次是規畫各種制度，使國家穩定地成長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-29","sourceFront":"政府","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"都市人口如果過度成長，容易引發環保及交通問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-08","sourceFront":"引發","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人的性格主要是受成長環境的影響，跟性別沒有太大的關係。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-20","sourceFront":"性別","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-2-09\",\"開朗\",\"開朗\",\"开朗\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"哥哥的性格開朗、樂觀，遇到麻煩也不會往壞處想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-09","sourceFront":"開朗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那對雙胞胎姐妹不但長得很像，連性格也一樣開朗、大方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-05","sourceFront":"雙胞胎","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我哥哥開朗活潑、高大英俊，難怪有很多女生追求他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-05","sourceFront":"英俊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在所有的同事中，我覺得小周最好相處了。他的性格開朗、說話幽默，還常主動幫忙，跟他相處起來很愉快、很自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-07","sourceFront":"相處","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你別看她一臉害羞的樣子，在熟人面前她可是很開朗的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-09","sourceFront":"熟人","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"To 開(open) a 朗(bright): 開朗 means cheerful."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-15\",\"設備\",\"設備\",\"设备\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這所大學有最新的電腦設備，提供學生很好的學習環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-15","sourceFront":"設備","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了提供學生良好的學習環境，學校改善了教室的設備，網路的速度也變快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-06","sourceFront":"良好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠自從改善了設備以後，生產速度就一天比一天快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-01","sourceFront":"自從","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學生與校長當面對話，希望學校改善教學設備和校園餐廳的服務品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟大樓有安全系統的設備，小偷進去就會自動發出警告的聲音通知警察。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對現代人來說，電腦和網路絕對是辦公室的主要設備。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-09","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座古老的城市因為公共設備太舊，購物也不方便，不少人都搬走了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-05","sourceFront":"古老","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為學校缺乏經費，宿舍的電腦設備暫時沒辦法改善。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-17","sourceFront":"經費","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠的設備及員工都嚴重缺乏，哪裡有辦法進一步發展？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-39","sourceFront":"哪裡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是你想建議公司採購新設備，可以上網填採購單。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-11","sourceFront":"採購","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今年學校的預算只夠修理宿舍的衛生設備，其他需要改善的只能等到明年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-16","sourceFront":"預算","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這臺食品加工設備的構造相當複雜，其中約三分之一的零件還是由國外進口。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-05","sourceFront":"由","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 設(build) and 備(prepare): 設備 means equipment."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-13\",\"數字\",\"數字\",\"数字\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華人喜歡像二、六、八的數字，這幾個數字都是雙數，有很多好事一起來的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-14","sourceFront":"雙數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"Combining 數(count) and 字(character): 數字 means number."},{"key":"[\"B3L04-1-29\",\"檸檬\",\"檸檬\",\"柠檬\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Writing the fragrant sour citrus fruit with 檸(lemon) and 檬(lemon): 檸檬 means lemon."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-1-28\",\"表\",\"表\",\"表\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華人用不一樣的動物代表每一年，一共有十二種動物。","pinyin":"Huárén yòng bù yíyàng de dòngwù dàibiǎo měi yì nián, yígòng yǒu shí'èr zhǒng dòngwù.","english":"Chinese use different animals to represent each year, and there are a total of twelve kinds of animals.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 龶(growing plant) lifts a 𧘇(clothing top) high for all to see → 表(show)."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-19\",\"居住\",\"居住\",\"居住\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那棟公寓自從三年前的一場大火之後，就不適合居住了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-19","sourceFront":"居住","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"心裡很平靜(peaceful)的人，就算居住在人車又多又吵的市區，仍然覺得自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-36","sourceFront":"市區","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"潮溼的居住環境不僅使家具不容易保養，並且更可能傷害人體健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-19","sourceFront":"潮溼","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 居(live) and 住(reside): 居住 means reside, to live."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-1-31\",\"人民幣\",\"人民幣\",\"人民币\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"中國開放國內投資後，想投資人民幣的人也越來越多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-31","sourceFront":"人民幣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L02-2-21\",\"利息\",\"利息\",\"利息\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你在銀行存的錢越多，得到的利息也越多。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-21","sourceFront":"利息","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-18\",\"日用品\",\"日用品\",\"日用品\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"對上班族來說，上網買牙刷、內衣褲、面紙等日用品，既輕鬆又方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-18","sourceFront":"日用品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家商店不只賣日用品，另外也賣食品和文具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-19","sourceFront":"另外","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-29\",\"搖\",\"搖\",\"摇\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"醫生告訴我，喝這瓶藥前得先搖一搖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-29","sourceFront":"搖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我坐在公園裡看著花兒隨著風搖擺，那個樣子真是可愛極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-17","sourceFront":"搖擺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"球員的表現讓教練不斷搖頭，並表示得加強平常的訓練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-31","sourceFront":"搖頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-51\",\"尿\",\"尿\",\"尿\",\"Vi/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"媽媽發現嬰兒尿得整件內褲都是尿，就幫他換了新的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-51","sourceFront":"尿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-2-08\",\"布告\",\"布告/佈告\",\"布告\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"公司的布告上貼著超市打折活動的廣告，感覺真的很怪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-08","sourceFront":"布告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"學校的布告欄總是隨著季節改變而有不同的設計。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-07","sourceFront":"布告欄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-15\",\"安装\",\"安裝\",\"安装\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她在嬰兒車上安裝了一排不同顏色的小燈，看起來很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-15","sourceFront":"安裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"路上安裝紅綠燈，是要保障民眾的交通安全。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-13","sourceFront":"保障","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-32\",\"顆\",\"顆\",\"颗\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"自從開始掉頭髮以後，醫師就建議他每天吃半顆維他命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-32","sourceFront":"顆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-2-30\",\"陈列\",\"陳列\",\"陈列\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華語書籍陳列在書架的左邊，如有興趣可隨意翻翻。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-30","sourceFront":"陳列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-09\",\"赢得\",\"贏得\",\"赢得\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她參加這場比賽的唯一目的，就是為了贏得第一名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-09","sourceFront":"贏得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"經過多次訓練，他總算贏得這場球賽的冠軍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-10","sourceFront":"冠軍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"以往\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 以(according to) and 往(go): 以往 means formerly, in the past."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"利\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Harvesting stalks of golden 禾(grain) with a sharp curved 刂(knife) yields abundant agricultural 利(gains)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"唱歌\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"唱(sing) + 歌(song) → to sing a song."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"天\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 一(one) line rests over a 大(big) figure → one more 天(day) under the sky."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"打電話\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"打(hit) + 電(electricity) + 話(talk) → you hit the electric talk: 打電話(to make a phone call)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"殖民\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 殖(breed) and 民(citizens): 殖民 means colonize."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"燈會\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"燈(lamp) + 會(gathering) → a gathering of lamps: the Lantern Carnival."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"舒服\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Relaxed (舒) clothes (服) feel comfortable."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"購買\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 購(buy) and 買(buy): 購買 means buy."}]}
